Hence, I pass the following:
NC: 2023:KHC-D:8874 ORDER i) The petition is allowed;
ii) M.C.No.1395/2023 filed by the respondent, pending on the file of the V Additional Principal Judge, Family Court, Bengaluru shall stand transferred to the Court of Senior Civil Judge and JMFC, Kudligi;
iii) Both parties shall appear before the Court of the Senior Civil Judge and JMFC,
Kudligi, on 04.09.2023, without the requirement of issuing fresh notice in this regard;
iv) The transferee Court upon transfer shall conduct further proceedings in accordance with law;
v) All contentions of the parties are kept open.
